 "notes": "Restraint only. Tuners cut from 17 to 10 (BOSS, TC Electronic, Korg, Peterson, Snark, D'Addario, Fender); dropped duplicates of retained lines (BOSS TU-02, TC PolyTune Clip, Peterson StroboVUE, Snark ST-8 HPT, D'Addario PW-CT-15) and single-brand niche items (Taylor Beacon, Walrus Canvas Tuner, Kala tuner range, Soundbrenner Core from tuner ranges). Metronomes: dropped Korg MetroClip, Soundbrenner Spark, Tama RW30 as duplicates of retained lines. Seiko and Wittner named in brief are not in old data and were not added (no research). Practice mute types moved to t."
